    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AFRICA\nDONG KINGMAN\nAFRICA\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nAfrica is a continent of great natural beauty. In addition to abundant wild game it contains a\nmixture of mountains, jungles, magnificent rivers, open plains, and arid deserts\nMany of its cities are bustling metropolises with broad avenues, modern buildings.\ngood restaurants and fine hotels, including several Inter • Continental Hotels\nFrom New York, Pan Am 747's serve Dakar, Monrovia, Accra, Lagos, Abidjan, and Nairobi.\nMr. Kingman s painting depicts majestic, snowcapped Mount Kilamanjaro in Tanzania\nAt 19,340 feet it is Africa's highest mountain.",
      "Fist Class Menus\nLibationdo\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan\nGin Martini Vodka Martini Vermouth\nBloody Mary\nScrewdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins\nVodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian\nGin Vodka Rum\nPremium Beer\nCoffee\nDelectationso\nSmoked Salmon with Capers\nSmoked pink Nova Scotia Salmon with fresh creamed horseradish\nand non pareil capers in deviled egg\nFilet Mignon Bordelaise\nGrilled select beef tenderloin steak with a rich red wine sauce\nServed with a delicate spinach soufflé in broiled tomato\nChicken Suprême Smitane\nTender breast of pullet with a spritely sauce of white wine,\nflavorful broth and heavy cream\nServed with buttery egg noodles and fresh mushrooms\nCold Collation Bellevue\nEnticing cold meats and select cheeses, all julienne cut,\nwith crisp greens and complemented by savoury relishes.\nServed with a tangy Remoulade Sauce\nParfait Tropique\nCoconut and orange ice creams in a tropical taste medley\nTea\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nD.4210\n2001.080.021"
    ],
